<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>IMSS — Iniciar Sesión</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@4.6.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont@latest/tabler-icons.min.css">
    <style>
        :root { --imss-green: #006847; --imss-green-dark: #004d34; }

        body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; }

        /* ── Header institucional gob.mx ── */
        .gov-header { background: #003828; }
        .gov-header .navbar { min-height: 48px; padding: 0; }
        .gov-header .navbar-brand img { height: 55px; margin: 6px 0; }
        .gov-header .nav-link { color: #fff !important; font-size: .82rem; padding: .75rem .9rem; }
        .gov-header .nav-link:hover { color: #ccc !important; }
        .gov-header .nav-link img { height: 16px; }

        /* ── Contenido central ── */
        .login-main {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 3rem 1rem;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* Panel izquierdo: branding transparente sobre fondo del main */
        .login-panel-image {
            flex: 1;
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 3rem 2rem 3rem 1.5rem;
            min-height: 420px;
        }
        .login-panel-image .panel-brand {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .login-panel-image .panel-brand img {
            height: 72px;
            filter: none;
            display: block;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .login-panel-image .panel-brand .brand-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
        }
        .login-panel-image .panel-brand h1 {
            color: #003828;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.25;
            margin-bottom: .6rem;
            letter-spacing: -.01em;
        }

        .login-panel-image .panel-brand p {
            color: #2d6a50;
            font-size: .9rem;
            margin: 0;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .login-panel-image .panel-badge {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(0,104,71,.12);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,104,71,.25);
            color: #004d34;
            font-size: .72rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: .35rem 1rem;
            margin-top: 1.8rem;
            letter-spacing: .03em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        /* Panel derecho: formulario */
        .login-panel-form {
            width: 420px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .login-form-card {
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 22px;
            box-shadow: 0 24px 64px rgba(0,0,0,.22);
            padding: 3rem 3rem;
        }
        .login-title { font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1a2e1f; margin-bottom: .2rem; }
        .login-sub   { font-size: .82rem; color: #6c757d; margin-bottom: 1.6rem; display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .35rem; }
        .sys-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(0,104,71,.10);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,104,71,.25);
            color: #004d34;
            font-size: .7rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: .2rem .75rem;
            letter-spacing: .04em;
        }

        .form-label   { font-weight: 600; font-size: .82rem; color: #495057; margin-bottom: .35rem; }
        .input-group-text {
            background: #fff; border: 1.5px solid #d1dbe6;
            border-right: none; border-radius: 10px 0 0 10px; color: #8fa0b0;
        }
        .form-control {
            border: 1.5px solid #d1dbe6; border-left: none;
            border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0; background: #fff;
            font-size: .9rem; padding: .58rem .85rem;
            transition: border-color .15s, box-shadow .15s;
        }
        .form-control:focus {
            border-color: var(--imss-green);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(0,104,71,.1);
        }
        .btn-login {
            background: var(--imss-green); color: #fff; border: none;
            border-radius: 10px; padding: .75rem; font-size: .95rem; font-weight: 600;
            width: 100%; margin-top: 1.4rem;
            transition: background .15s, box-shadow .15s;
        }
        .btn-login:hover { background: var(--imss-green-dark); box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,104,71,.35); color: #fff; }
        .show-pass-btn {
            background: #fff; border: 1.5px solid #d1dbe6; border-left: none;
            border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0; color: #8fa0b0; cursor: pointer;
            padding: 0 .75rem;
        }
        .show-pass-btn:hover { color: var(--imss-green); }
        .login-footer-note {
            margin-top: 1.75rem;
            text-align: center; font-size: .72rem; color: #adb5bd;
        }

        /* Wrapper centrado */
        .login-split {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 900px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        /* Responsive: apilar en móvil */
        @media (max-width: 767px) {
            .login-panel-image { display: none; }
            .login-panel-form { width: 100%; }
        }

        /* ── Footer institucional gob.mx ── */
        .gov-footer {
            background-image: url('/images/footer-background.jpg');
            background-color: #222;
            background-size: cover;
            padding: 2rem 0;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: .82rem;
        }
        .gov-footer .list__title { font-weight: 700; font-size: .85rem; color: #fff; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
        .gov-footer ul.list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
        .gov-footer ul.list li { margin-bottom: .25rem; }
        .gov-footer ul.list li a { color: rgba(255,255,255,.8); text-decoration: none; }
        .gov-footer ul.list li a:hover { color: #fff; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

{# ══ HEADER INSTITUCIONAL GOB.MX ══ #}
<header class="gov-header">
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-md container">
        <a class="navbar-brand" href="https://www.gob.mx/" target="_blank">
            <img src="https://framework-gb.cdn.gob.mx/landing/img/logoheader.png" alt="logo gobierno de méxico">
        </a>
        <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#govNav" style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.3);">
            <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="collapse navbar-collapse justify-content-end" id="govNav">
            <ul class="navbar-nav">
                <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="https://www.gob.mx/tramites">Trámites</a></li>
                <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="https://www.gob.mx/gobierno">Gobierno</a></li>
                <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="https://www.gob.mx/busqueda"><img src="https://framework-gb.cdn.gob.mx/landing/img/lupa.png" alt="Buscar"></a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </nav>
</header>

{# ══ ZONA CENTRAL — SPLIT LAYOUT ══ #}
<main class="login-main">
<div class="login-split">

    {# ── Panel izquierdo: branding ── #}
    <div class="login-panel-image">
        <div class="panel-brand">
            <div class="brand-header">
                <img src="/images/logo_IMSS_verde.png" alt="IMSS">
                <h1>Instituto Mexicano del Seguro Social</h1>
            </div>
            <p>Coordinación de Educación en Salud</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    {# ── Panel derecho: formulario ── #}
    <div class="login-panel-form">
    <div class="login-form-card">

        <div class="login-title">Inicio de sesión</div>
        <div class="login-sub">
            <span class="sys-badge">FOFOE</span>
            <span class="sys-badge">SICACES</span>
        </div>

        {% if error %}
        <div class="alert alert-danger py-2 px-3" style="border-radius:10px;font-size:.84rem;">
            <i class="ti ti-alert-circle mr-1"></i>
            {{ error.messageKey|trans(error.messageData, 'security') }}
        </div>
        {% endif %}

        <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_login') }}" autocomplete="off">
            <input type="hidden" name="_csrf_token" value="{{ csrf_token('authenticate') }}">

            <div class="form-group mb-3">
                <label class="form-label" for="_matricula">Matrícula</label>
                <div class="input-group">
                    <div class="input-group-prepend">
                        <span class="input-group-text"><i class="ti ti-user"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <input type="text" id="_matricula" name="_username"
                           class="form-control" value="{{ last_username }}"
                           placeholder="Ej. 12345678" autofocus required>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group mb-1">
                <label class="form-label" for="_password">Contraseña</label>
                <div class="input-group">
                    <div class="input-group-prepend">
                        <span class="input-group-text"><i class="ti ti-lock"></i></span>
                    </div>
                    <input type="password" id="_password" name="_password"
                           class="form-control" placeholder="••••••••" required>
                    <div class="input-group-append">
                        <button type="button" class="show-pass-btn" onclick="togglePass()" title="Mostrar">
                            <i class="ti ti-eye" id="eye-icon"></i>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="btn-login">
                <i class="ti ti-login mr-2"></i>Ingresar al Sistema
            </button>
        </form>

        <div class="login-footer-note">
            Uso exclusivo para personal autorizado del IMSS
        </div>
    </div>{# /login-form-card #}
    </div>{# /login-panel-form #}

</div>{# /login-split #}
</main>

{# ══ FOOTER INSTITUCIONAL GOB.MX ══ #}
<footer class="gov-footer">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-3 mb-3">
                <img src="https://framework-gb.cdn.gob.mx/landing/img/logofooter.png"
                     style="width:229px;height:76px;" alt="logo gobierno de méxico">
            </div>
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-3 mb-3">
                <p class="list__title">Enlaces</p>
                <ul class="list">
                    <li><a href="https://www.gob.mx/participa">Participa</a></li>
                    <li><a href="https://www.gob.mx/publicaciones">Publicaciones Oficiales</a></li>
                    <li><a href="http://www.ordenjuridico.gob.mx/">Marco Jurídico</a></li>
                    <li><a href="https://consultapublicamx.inai.org.mx/vut-web/">Plataforma Nacional de Transparencia</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-3 mb-3">
                <p class="list__title">¿Qué es gob.mx?</p>
                <ul class="list">
                    <li><a href="https://www.gob.mx/que-es-gobmx">Es el portal único de trámites, información y participación ciudadana.</a></li>
                    <li><a href="https://datos.gob.mx/">Portal de datos abiertos</a></li>
                    <li><a href="https://www.gob.mx/accesibilidad">Declaración de accesibilidad</a></li>
                    <li><a href="https://www.gob.mx/privacidadintegral">Aviso de privacidad integral</a></li>
                    <li><a href="https://www.gob.mx/terminos">Términos y condiciones</a></li>
                    <li><a href="https://www.gob.mx/sitemap">Mapa del sitio</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-3 mb-3">
                <p class="list__title">Otros trámites</p>
                <ul class="list">
                    <li>Mesa de ayuda: dudas e información</li>
                    <li><a href="mailto:gobmx@funcionpublica.gob.mx">gobmx@funcionpublica.gob.mx</a></li>
                    <li>Denuncia contra servidores públicos</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/jquery@3.5.1/dist/jquery.slim.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@4.6.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
<script>
function togglePass() {
    const input = document.getElementById('_password');
    const icon  = document.getElementById('eye-icon');
    if (input.type === 'password') {
        input.type = 'text';
        icon.classList.replace('ti-eye', 'ti-eye-off');
    } else {
        input.type = 'password';
        icon.classList.replace('ti-eye-off', 'ti-eye');
    }
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
